Subject: [PATCH 0/2] smb/client: fix races with concurrent nlink updates

This series fixes two races caused by concurrent nlink revalidation.

Patch 1 uses the saved nlink to avoid marking handles opened through
surviving hard links as deleted.

Patch 2 uses the saved nlink to avoid decrementing an already updated
link count.

Huiwen He (2):
  smb/client: use pre-request nlink when marking deleted handles
  smb/client: avoid dropping a concurrently updated nlink

